<title>USA: Disney's &quot;The Lion King&quot; to hit Broadway.</title>
<headline>Disney's &quot;The Lion King&quot; to hit Broadway.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co said on Wednesday that &quot;The Lion King&quot; will become a Broadway musical production in the fall of 1997.</p>
<p>The production will be at the New Amsterdam Theatre on 42nd Street. The director is Julie Taymor.</p>
<p>Preview performances will begin in New York in the fall of 1997. A pre-Broadway engagement will begin an eight-week schedule in July 1997 in Minneapolis.</p>
</text>
